※ pl4g-test: compile=error
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4900 LANG_CLAUSE_NOT_MET

※ A bundle whose line the types do not meet reports three places: the line, in
※ the bundle's own definition; the clause that applied the bundle; and the call
※ whose types were asked about.

bundle number(T'):  T' ⊞ T' → T'

fn total(a: T', b: T') → T' pre(number(T')):
    a ⊞ b

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    ⎕narrow(total(true, false), ⌜u6⌝) ?? 1u6
